            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P6TW1I",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "D166: Velita floats bottom-right above the BottomNav on every authenticated screen; a tap opens the D11 drawer (route first, dialog as presentation), seeded with suggestions from the current screen. Desktop: a non-modal side panel. The ? popover offers «Pregúntale a Velita». Configured in Ajustes · Asistente (D167). Inert with no connection: Velita does not render.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "WlwO3",
          "name": "Screens (left → right)",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "m1Bj8p",
              "name": "h",
              "fill": "$fg-subtle",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "SCREENS (LEFT → RIGHT)",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dbadU",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Hoy: Velita en reposo → Drawer abierto → Drawer · Respuesta → Drawer · Fuentes abiertas → Conversaciones anteriores → Drawer · Descartada. Panorama · Desktop: Panel abierto. Ajustes · Asistente: Conectada → Sin configurar → Error de conexión. Entradas: Hoy · Ayuda con Pregúntale → Detalle NVDA · Drawer con el símbolo. Velita sheet above the kit row.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "R42bdi",
          "name": "Business rules",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GiryR",
              "name": "h",
              "fill": "$fg-subtle",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "BUSINESS RULES",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "r9SXOb",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Velita is static at rest — it moves only while the drawer is open and work is running (seen on every screen, every day). Content leaves bottom padding so it never covers the last row. A turn is the reader's question with its time, then the answer, then what it read folded under «Lo que leí» (D171); [n] opens its card. Prose may only cite numbers present in the cards, else it is discarded and «Preguntar de nuevo» is offered (ADR-031 §2). The disclaimer shows once per thread. Earlier conversations reopen from the history; a follow-up carries the last three questions, never their answers (D172). Velita never reacts to a gain, loss or market direction (§7). It reads no holdings (§5).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "s7voZ",
          "name": "Copy source",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RhFcO",
              "name": "h",
              "fill": "$fg-subtle",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "COPY SOURCE",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s3Bt0",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Reused from es-MX.yml: dashboard.ayuda.vs_cetes (Contra CETES), alerts rsi_overbought.porque, market.lecturas.rsi.overbought, the ayuda pie (adapted: «de datos», not «de tus datos»), «Cotización del %{date} · CDMX», «Lectura del %{fecha}». NEW, not in code: Pregunta, «Desde Hoy · no ve tus posiciones», DE LO QUE ESTÁS VIENDO, the three suggestions, TU PREGUNTA, step labels, Pregunta lo que quieras / otra cosa, Glosario de Stockerly, «Tu cifra de Hoy no la veo…». Settings reuse admin.integrations.index (API key, Verificar conexión, Guardar). NEW: Mostrar a Velita and its lines, Apariencia, Forma, Color, Conexión and its privacy line, Formato, Host, Para planear, Para redactar, the provider note, SIN CONFIGURAR, NO RESPONDE and its reason, Pregúntale a Velita, «Abre con esta frase ya escrita», «Sobre NVDA · no ve tus posiciones». Prose, rates, prices and models are illustrative.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
