              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RHwYX",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Velita motion (ui-motion) · Sin dato (G6) · provider down mid-answer (failed: link to Ajustes plus «Preguntar de nuevo», same layout as Descartada) · drawer streaming states (Buscando… / Escribiendo…, string swaps) · history empty («Todavía no le has preguntado nada a Velita.») · the hub row that leads to Ajustes · Asistente · desktop settings (one column, reflows).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
