            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l6WP5X",
              "name": "b",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "D166 proposed (entry point). Connection lives in Ajustes · Asistente, not in Integraciones: that screen is «De dónde salen tus precios» and its rows carry a source role an LLM does not have; storage is still an Integration row (plan §6.3, no migration). Shapes and colours ship after P1's signal; P1 is the Vela in índigo. Colours exclude chart-3/4/5 (gain, warning, loss). Suggestions must be answerable by a capability — no «por qué» that invites a cause. RSI has no market.metricas entry. UI name (Q5) open. Velita promotion to the kit is its own decision.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
